<section id="what-we-do" class="even-sections">
    <div class="container-fluid d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"></div>
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h2 class="brand-text display-2">What We Do</h2>
      <div class="text-start">
        <p>This is an overview of the types of rides and activities you can expect with Fleet Mucky Mayhem.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row text-start">
        <div class="accordion accordion-flush text-dark text-start" id="ride-types">

          <!-- Introductory Rides-->
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed lead brand-text" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#introductory-rides">
                Introductory Rides:
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="introductory-rides" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#ride-types">
              <div class="accordion-body body-text">
                <p>These are very social off-road rides, everyone helps and supports each other. They are
                  just about getting out and riding, we don't care what you ride or what you wear, but
                  please have appropriate tyres for the off-road conditions (muddy over
                  Autumn/Winter!).</p>
                <p>No bike, no problem! We have a couple of suitable bikes that we lend out if you wish to
                  try out a ride.</p>
                <p>Whether you are just starting out on your riding journey or want to use cycling to get a
                  healthier lifestyle, this is an ideal starting point.</p>
                <p>We aim to put on rides that are one or two times a month, 30 - 60 mins in duration,
                  average 6-8mph (9.5-13kph).</p>
                <p>Please see link for start location - <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/Rz6o6LjYwvr6974ZA"
                    target="_blank" class="brand-text">Google Maps <i
                      class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right brand-text link-icon"></i></a></p>
                <p>Arrive : 09:20 (This differs to Regular Rides)</p>
                <p>Depart : 09:30</p>
                <p>Routes and dates advised via <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/LJ1XZhB7KprApZhr4plhGD"
                    target="_blank" class="brand-text">WhatsApp Group <i
                      class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right brand-text link-icon"></i></a>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Regular Rides -->
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed lead brand-text" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#regular-rides">
                Regular Rides:
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="regular-rides" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#ride-types">
              <div class="accordion-body body-text">
                <p>These are very social off-road rides, everyone helps and supports each other. They are just about
                  getting out and riding, we don't care what you ride or what you wear, but please have appropriate
                  tyres for the off-road conditions (muddy over Autumn/Winter!)</p>
                <p>No bike, no problem! We have a couple of suitable bikes that we lend out if you wish to try out a
                  ride.</p>
                <p>Rides are typically be 90 - 120 mins, three times month, average 8-10mph (13-16kph).</p>
                <p>Rides depart at 09:30 (back in Fleet around noon), if new, please arrive at least 5 mins early.</p>
                <p>Please see link for start location - <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/Rz6o6LjYwvr6974ZA"
                    target="_blank" class="brand-text">Google Maps <i
                      class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right brand-text link-icon"></i></a></p>
                <p>Routes and dates advised via <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/LJ1XZhB7KprApZhr4plhGD"
                    target="_blank" class="brand-text">WhatsApp Group <i
                      class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right brand-text link-icon"> </i></a>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Longer Rides -->
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed lead brand-text" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#longer-rides">
                Longer Rides:
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="longer-rides" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#ride-types">
              <div class="accordion-body body-text">
                <p>These are very social off-road rides, everyone helps and supports each other. They are just about
                  getting out and riding, we don't care what you ride or what you wear, but please have appropriate
                  tyres for the off-road conditions (muddy over Autumn/Winter!)</p>
                <p>These will be run once a month aimed at riding slightly further as the year progresses, building to
                  the longest ride of the year in August time. Average 8-10mph (13-16kph).</p>
                <p>Please see <a href="#ride-diary" class="brand-text">Ride Diary</a> for examples.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>


          <!-- Social Events -->
          <div class="accordion-item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
              <button class="accordion-button collapsed lead brand-text" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#social-events">
                Social Events:
              </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="social-events" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#ride-types">
              <div class="accordion-body body-text">
                <p>We aim that all rides have a cafe stop, part way or at the end.</p>
                <p>Once a month during the week (no ride) we head for food, drink and chat at a local pub.</p>
                <p>Events advised via <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/LJ1XZhB7KprApZhr4plhGD" target="_blank"
                    class="brand-text">WhatsApp Group <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right brand-text link-icon">
                    </i></a>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
